Barista Apps is the open userland for Barista: the App Manifest, the Host API,
provider conformance tests, a local single-user provider, SDKs, and first-party
reference apps (Pi, Claude Code, Codex, Factory, Lift, Session Story).

It depends on released `barista.sh` (github.com/mpuig/barista.sh) contracts and
targets the Host API defined in this repository; it must not import or depend
on Barista Cloud or any other proprietary component.
